[68.346693, "o", "\u001b[29A\u001b[4G\u001b[K\u001b[90mermissions: auto-allow\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[3G\u001b[K\u001b[90mTip: Run \u001b[1m/model\u001b[22m to switch models on the fly.\u001b[39m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[2m\u2298 Indexing skipped: no project root found\u001b[22m\r\r\n\u001b[E\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[48;5;235m\u001b[38;5;255m > Activate your impeccable skill, then create index.html in the current directory containing a \u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[48;5;235m\u001b[38;5;255msingle plain unstyled <button>Click me</button>. Critique it using impeccable design principles and \u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[48;5;235m\u001b[38;5;255mrewrite index.html with a polished, accessible, beautifully styled button (inline CSS, no external \u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[48;5;235m\u001b[38;5;255mresources). Finally, print a one-line summary of the improvements you made. \u001b[39m\u001b[49m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[KI'll activate the impeccable skill first.\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;208m\u25b6 \u001b[39m \u001b[38;5;35m\u25cf \u001b[39m\u001b[2mRan skill(Skill \"impeccable\" activated inline. Following ...) 0.0s\u001b[22m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\r\r\n\u001b[6G\u001b[Krun the impeccable context setup first.\r\r\n\u001b[E\u001b[10G\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;208m\u001b[39m\u001b[38;5;35m\u001b[39m\u001b[2mbash(/tmp/imp-src/tests/oracle/workspaces/ctx-pin/.c...) 5.0s\u001b[22m\r\r\n\u001b[E\u001b[1G\u001b[KThe skill is active. Let me run the context setup from the installed skill directory.\r\r\n\u001b[E\u001b[15G\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;208m\u001b[39m\u001b[38;5;35m\u001b[39m\u001b[2mNO_PRODUCT_MD: This project has no PRODUCT.md y...) 0.0s\u001b[22m\r\r\n\u001b[1G\u001b[K\u001b[38;5;136m|\u001b[39m Conjuring \u001b[2m0.0s\u001b[22m\r\r\n\u001b[E\u001b[E\u001b[E\u001b[18G\u001b[K       \u001b[32m\u28a0\u28fa\u28d7\u2844\u001b[39m         \u001b[36m\u28a0\